":"Kog团队在标准数据中心GPU上实现了极高的单用户推理速度，在8× AMD MI300X GPUs上达到3,000 tokens/s，在8× NVIDIA H200上达到2,100 tokens/s。相比常规推理速度（约100-300 tokens/s），实现了10-30倍提升。其核心思路是将LLM解码视为内存流问题，通过协同设计monokernel、重建同步机制、针对性内存访问映射及采用延迟张量并行的Laneformer模型架构，消除了传统流程的阻塞点。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpr6nk7c0bf4slnok93x9vov","originalUrl":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2060409504693645440","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T17:58:35.180Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1sngkqe","originalSourceName":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","family":"outlet-1lanm2l","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpr6nk7c0bf4slnok93x9vov","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1sngkqe","name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-06T00:17:31.139Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Kog团队在标准数据中心GPU上实现了极高的单用户推理速度，在8× AMD MI300X GPUs上达到3,000 tokens/s，在8× NVIDIA H200上达到2,100 tokens/s。相比常规推理速度（约100-300 tokens/s），实现了10-30倍提升。其核心思路是将LLM解码视为内存流问题，通过协同设计monokernel、重建同步机制、针对性内存访问映射及采用延迟张量并行的Laneformer模型架构，消除了传统流程的阻塞点。","reportEdition":"2026-05-30","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmpr8syeh0bxsslno0wmufg9r","title":"当公司过于\"AI上瘾\"时会发生什么？","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T17:58:35.180Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmpr8syeh0bxsslno0wmufg9r","https://techcrunch.com/video/what-happens-when-companies-become-too-ai-pilled"],"articles":[{"